  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><blockquote data-lake-id=\"u8e3a6040\" id=\"u8e3a6040\"><p data-lake-id=\"u9bea9247\" id=\"u9bea9247\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubdc0c4c0\" id=\"ubdc0c4c0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">我们就可以自己在图形化配置界面中来自定义一个菜单，</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uef82e215\" id=\"uef82e215\"><span data-lake-id=\"udf4654bd\" id=\"udf4654bd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">要定义 一个菜单，就要从 Kconfig 文件入手。因为图形化配置界面是 根据 Kconfig 文件来生成的！</span></p></blockquote><h1 data-lake-id=\"pu5vG\" id=\"pu5vG\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7708e333\" id=\"u7708e333\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">从Kconfig到menuconfig</span></h1><ol list=\"uf94b57a9\"><li fid=\"u14a913ba\" data-lake-id=\"u26affb98\" id=\"u26affb98\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4a5ac01c\" id=\"u4a5ac01c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">在kernel下创建tony文件夹,并创建Kconfig文件</span></li><li fid=\"u14a913ba\" data-lake-id=\"u86aad10d\" id=\"u86aad10d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue1451fa4\" id=\"ue1451fa4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">打开kernel下的Kconfig,编辑,增加</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u0d608d3b\" id=\"u0d608d3b\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F34933095%2F1739868203738-f965c19d-4042-49bb-a5cb-0c76956b2d37.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u0d620bb7-4605-4903-afaf-0d2de6e01da%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ue555bc03-d297-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A505.3333333333333%2C%22height%22%3A366%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A99923%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1137%2C%22originHeight%22%3A823%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%5C%22KERNEL%2FKCONFIG.FREEZER%22%2C%22x%22%3A85%2C%22y%22%3A285%2C%22widt