9)\">depends on</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u61402a8b\" id=\"u61402a8b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\"> 和 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue57ceec5\" id=\"ue57ceec5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">select</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uac1037e2\" id=\"uac1037e2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uadbda94a\" id=\"uadbda94a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7f090cba\" id=\"u7f090cba\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">depends on 表示直接依赖关系：</span></strong></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22config%20A%5Cn%20%20%20%20depends%20on%20B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tkqS0%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u9c22a99a\" id=\"u9c22a99a\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaf891749\" id=\"uaf891749\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">表示选项A依赖选项B，只有当B选项被选中时，A选项才可以被选中。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud5aceaed\" id=\"ud5aceaed\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2437c179\" id=\"u2437c179\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">select 表示反向依赖关系：</span></strong></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22config%20A%5Cn%20%20%20%20select%20B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ccWWG%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u578f82a6\" id=\"u578f82a6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0a596488\" id=\"u0a596488\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">在A选项被选中的情况下，B选项自动被选中。</span></p>",
